00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:20.590
("Spotify Song")

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:32.057
- Gen Z is streaming natives,

00:08:32.057 --> 00:08:34.330
but they're immigrants to opening a CD

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:35.390
and peeling the sticker off,

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:36.670
and looking at the liner notes

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:37.850
