00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.250
They don't know anything about that.

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:41.500
But I think, what were
you talking about, genre?

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.855
What were you talking about?

00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:44.975
(inspirational music sting)

